          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In Fuuraiki 4, you can enjoy the scenery from every angle, captured with a 360-degree camera in Gifu Prefecture—the heart of Japan.\n\nThe series, which will celebrate its 20th anniversary in 2021, has gained popularity as an adventure game in which you travel by motorcycle across beautiful, real-life scenery—and occasionally meet girls along the way.\n\nDiscover the unseen side of Gifu on a new motorcycle touring adventure.",
